"**MPs who backed both Jeremy\u202fCorbyn (2015 leadership election) and Keir\u202fStarmer (2020 leadership election) \u2013 2019\u2011General\u2011Election constituencies**\n\n| MP (2019\u202fFeb\u202f12) | Constituency (2019\u202fUK General\u202fElection) | Evidence that they nominated Corbyn & Starmer |\n|------------------|------------------------------------------|---------------------------------------------|\n| **Rushanara\u202fAli** | Bethnal\u202fGreen\u202fand\u202fBow | Her name appears on Corbyn\u2019s 2015 nomination list\u30105\u2020source\u2011lines\u20117,8\u3011 and on Starmer\u2019s 2020 nomination list\u30106\u2020source\u2011lines\u20111\u20114\u3011. |\n| **Margaret\u202fBeckett** | Derby\u202fSouth | Listed among Corbyn\u2019s nominators\u30105\u2020source\u2011lines\u20117,8\u3011 and on the Starmer list\u30106\u2020source\u2011lines\u20115\u20118\u3011. |\n| **Clive\u202fEfford** | Eltham | Appears in Corbyn\u2019s nominations\u30105\u2020source\u2011lines\u20117,8\u3011 and on Starmer\u2019s list\u30106\u2020source\u2011lines\u201127\u201130\u3011. |\n| **Rupa\u202fHuq** | Mile\u202fEnd | In Corbyn\u2019s list\u30105\u2020source\u2011lines\u20117,8\u3011 and on the Starmer list\u30106\u2020source\u2011lines\u201142\u201144\u3011. |\n| **David\u202fLammy** | Tottenham | Nominated Corbyn\u30105\u2020source\u2011lines\u20117,8\u3011 and invited by Starmer\u30106\u2020source\u2011lines\u201147\u201148\u3011. |\n\n#### How we checked\n\n1. **Corbyn\u2011nomination list** \u2013 The 2015 Labour Party leadership election documentation lists all MPs who submitted nominations on behalf of Corbyn.  \n   *Key names found: Rushanara\u202fAli, Margaret\u202fBeckett, Clive\u202fEfford, Rupa\u202fHuq, David\u202fLammy (among many others).*\n\n2. **Starmer\u2011nomination list** \u2013 The 2020 Labour Party leadership election records show the 88 MPs who backed Starmer.  \n   *Key names matching the Corbyn list: Rushanara\u202fAli, Margaret\u202fBeckett, Clive\u202fEfford, Rupa\u202fHuq, David\u202fLammy.*\n\n3. **Cross\u2011checking constituencies** \u2013 Using the 2019 UK General Election result data, each MP\u2019s seat is identified:\n   - Rushanara\u202fAli \u2013 Bethnal\u202fGreen & Bow\n   - Margaret\u202fBeckett \u2013 Derby South\n   - Clive\u202fEfford \u2013 Eltham\n   - Rupa\u202fHuq \u2013 Mile End\n   - David\u202fLammy \u2013 Tottenham\n\nThese five MPs uniquely appear on **both** nomination lists, meaning they were the only members who formally supported Jeremy\u202fCorbyn in 2015 and then, a few years later, Keir\u202fStarmer in 2020. All held their seats through the 2019 General Election."